 ⚖️ AdvoChat – Online Legal Consultation & Case Management System

 📌 Overview

AdvoChat is a Django-based web application that connects users with advocates for legal consultation, case management, and real-time communication. The platform digitizes legal processes such as case requests, advocate selection, document handling, and payments.

---

 🚀 Problem Statement

Traditional legal consultation processes are slow, manual, and lack transparency. This system aims to:

* Simplify communication between users and advocates
* Digitize case handling and document management
* Provide a centralized platform for legal services

---

 🧠 Intelligent Features

* Basic NLP setup using NLTK (for chatbot/processing support)
* Real-time chat system between user and advocate
* Smart advocate selection based on case category

---

 🛠️ Tech Stack

* Backend: Django
* Frontend: HTML, CSS, Bootstrap
* Database: SQLite
* Libraries & Tools:

  * NLTK (Natural Language Processing)
  * Django Authentication System
  * ReportLab (PDF invoice generation)
  * Email (SMTP integration)

---

 ✨ Features

 👤 User Module

* Register & login (OTP-based password reset)
* View advocates by category
* Book legal cases
* Upload multiple case documents
* Chat with advocates
* Make payments & download invoice
* Give feedback & ratings

---

 👨‍⚖️ Advocate Module

* Register with document verification & payment
* View and manage case requests
* Accept / reject cases
* Update case status (Ongoing, Completed, Failed)
* Upload case details & fees
* Chat with users
* View ratings and feedback

---

 🛠️ Admin Module

* Approve / reject users & advocates
* Manage IPC sections & case categories
* Monitor all case requests
* Dashboard analytics:

  * Total users
  * Total advocates
  * Case status statistics
* Manage feedback and ratings

---

 💬 Chat System

* Real-time messaging between user and advocate
* Stores chat history
* Separate interfaces for both roles

---

 📂 Case Management

* Case request creation
* Advocate assignment
* Advocate change request system
* File uploads (multiple documents)
* Case tracking:

  * Pending
  * Approved
  * Completed
  * Cancelled

---

 📄 Payment & Invoice

* Payment system for case fees
* Automatic PDF invoice generation using ReportLab
* Payment tracking and status updates

---

 📧 Email System

* OTP-based password reset
* Registration confirmation emails
* Case approval/rejection notifications
* Cancellation alerts

---

 📊 Key Functional Highlights

* Role-based authentication (Admin / User / Advocate)
* Secure password handling
* File upload & storage system
* Dynamic dashboard analytics
* Advocate rating system (average rating calculation)

---

 ⚙️ Installation & Setup

```bash id="k29dj2"
 Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/your-username/advochat.git

 Navigate to folder
cd advochat

 Create virtual environment
python -m venv env

 Activate environment
env\Scripts\activate    Windows
source env/bin/activate   Mac/Linux

 Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

 Apply migrations
python manage.py migrate

 Run server
python manage.py runserver
```

